Embedded data
-------------
The knowledge base embedded in this application (data/kb_data.json) is a
CURATED EDUCATIONAL SUBSET. Technique/pattern/weakness descriptions are
PARAPHRASED SUMMARIES written for this project — they are NOT official
framework text. Curated subsets are explicitly partial and labelled as such
in the application. Cross-framework mappings carry a source and a confidence
level (Official / Validated / Curated / Inferred); mappings that are not known
are omitted rather than invented. Detection guidance is curated educational
material, not validated detections.

